Artificial Intelligence (AI)
Simple Definition

Artificial Intelligence (AI) is the ability of a computer system to learn, analyze data, recognize patterns, and make intelligent decisions to solve a specific problem.

Workflow
Input
   │
   ▼
Analyze Data
   │
   ▼
Predict / Decide
   │
   ▼
Output

Real-Time Examples

| **Example**                      | **How it Works**                                                              |
| -------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| **Email Spam Detection**         | AI analyzes email content and predicts whether it is spam or not.             |
| **Netflix Movie Recommendation** | AI studies viewing history and recommends movies the user is likely to enjoy. |


